# Chromium is the web engine; Babel defines and launches the browser profile.
# Extensions can reach internal chrome pages; native sandbox and API permissions remain.
# The process API expects Data lists (array/push/boxstr), not typed list literals.
desktop_browser_open binary profile extensions url = processinherit binary push push push push push push array _ boxstr "--no-first-run" boxstr "--no-default-browser-check" boxstr "--extensions-on-chrome-urls" boxstr concat "--user-data-dir=" profile boxstr concat "--load-extension=" extensions boxstr url
